{
  "//": [
    "Layer table for the web client: server/static/src and server/static/packages/*/src (fabric/PROPOSAL.md, \"The layers\").",
    "A file may import from its own layer or one earlier in `order`. `unranked` layers may import anything and nothing ranked may import them.",
    "`packages` says which layer each package holds: every file of that layer is in that package and nothing else is.",
    "`rules` are checked after `files`, first match wins. `allow` lists upward imports with the reason each is still there; it is empty and only shrinks.",
    "`compat` files are the pre-package entry points game clients import by path (`../../src/client.js`); they only re-export from a package.",
    "Checked by scripts/check-layers.test.mjs (npm run test:layers), which also checks the package boundary: explicit exports, declared dependencies, no relative import across a package edge."
  ],
  "order": [
    "engine",
    "elements",
    "kit",
    "host"
  ],
  "unranked": [
    "test-support",
    "compat"
  ],
  "packages": {
    "packages/elements": "elements",
    "packages/renderer-kit": "kit"
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "prefix": "src/engine/",
      "layer": "engine"
    },
    {
      "prefix": "src/",
      "suffix": ".compile.ts",
      "layer": "test-support"
    },
    {
      "prefix": "src/testing/",
      "layer": "test-support"
    },
    {
      "prefix": "src/examples/",
      "layer": "test-support"
    }
